We begin by characterizing the overturning streamfunction as a function of density across the OSNAP sections, using CESM2 as an illustrative case (Fig. 1). Here and throughout the manuscript, MOC strength refers to the maximum of the density-space overturning streamfunction, with the corresponding density denoted as \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
